0:["PTF5f6zbP51hXl6zOpnuH",[[["",{"children":[["slug","seat-hidden-heroes-adrian","d"],{"children":["__PAGE__?{\"slug\":\"seat-hidden-heroes-adrian\"}",{}]}]},"$undefined","$undefined",true],["",{"children":[["slug","seat-hidden-heroes-adrian","d"],{"children":["__PAGE__",{},[["$L1",[[["$","script","schema-0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$2"}}],["$","script","schema-1",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"@id\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/seat-hidden-heroes-adrian#breadcrumb\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"News & Blog\",\"item\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voiceover-news\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Seat Hidden Heroes Adrian\",\"item\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/seat-hidden-heroes-adrian\"}]}"}}],["$","script","schema-2",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"VideoObject\",\"@id\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/seat-hidden-heroes-adrian#video\",\"name\":\"Seat Hidden Heroes Adrian\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/TV5U0bZm32g/maxresdefault.jpg\",\"embedUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/TV5U0bZm32g\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Guy Harris\",\"url\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voiceoverguy\",\"image\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-profile.jpg\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"VoiceoverGuy\",\"url\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-voiceover.png\"}},\"inLanguage\":\"en-GB\",\"description\":\"Seat Hidden Heroes Adrian Mateo. While listening to a track while driving in your SEAT, spare a thought for one of the people who made the sound possible.\",\"uploadDate\":\"2015-10-01T00:00:00+00:00\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Seat Hidden Heroes Adrian"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>A pleasure to be working with SEAT on a series of videos. The Hidden Heroes will reveal some of the incredible people working behind the scenes to bring you their incredible vehicles.</p>"}}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Check out the video</h2>\r\n<p>Next time you're listening to a cool track while cruising down the motorway in your SEAT, spare a thought for one of the people who made the superior sound possible - Adrian Mateo Presser, SEAT's guru behind the impressive car acoustics.</p>\r\n<p>So nice to be working with SEAT on the Hidden Heroes and more so to deliver this job in a very relaxed pace. Especially when compared to some of my other work. If you'd like to listen to my voiceover work on some other car-related videos, check out my <a href=\"/rac-car-passport-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"RAC Car Passport\">RAC Car Passport</a> video.</p>"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/TV5U0bZm32g","title":"Seat Hidden Heroes Adrian","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/seat-hidden-heroes-adrian.jpg","alt":"Seat Hidden Heroes Adrian","className":"blog-post-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Seat Hidden Heroes Adrian</h2>\r\n\r\n<p><em>You might think a pumped-up sound system is a given for quality cars nowadays, but to get the perfect audio balance takes a blend of technological know-how and a finely tuned ear. Adrian Mateo Presser is SEAT's man behind the music, providing a premium listening experience for every SEAT owner. His office is a 34m2 soundproof studio hidden deep inside the Spanish car company's HQ just outside Barcelona, where he experiments with sound to find out how to strike the right note with motorists.</em> You can find out more the range of cars and services available on Seat's website.</p>"}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>This is the Seat Hidden Heroes Adrian Mateo Presser video. There are more in this series. If you are looking for a voice similar to this tone and pace for your <a href=\"/commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">promo video</a> or <a href=\"/explainer-video-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer video</a> , then <a href=\"/contact-guy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Contact Guy\">get in touch</a>. To make the process even easier, just let me know the intended usage of the project and I can quote you more accurately. Feel free to send a short sample of the script and I'd be more than happy to send you a short audition to check if my voice is right for your brand.</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"Seat Hidden Heroes Adrian","pageUrl":"seat-hidden-heroes-adrian"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-str